From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:24:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Follow the machine's fontconfig sans-serif for the interface
 font and size, so desktops without XSettings stop falling back to MyGo's
 built-in face, with a setting and env overrides to opt out.

